    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 野兽（蜘蛛）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 18，''强韧'' 14，''反射'' 16，''意志'' 15</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，攀爬 6（蛛行）</span><span>''感官'' 震动感知 5</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬（毒素）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：2 点毒素伤害，且目标获得 5 点毒素易伤直到该幼蛛下回合结束。如果目标已经拥有毒素伤害易伤，则该易伤增加 2 点。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+9</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 11（+2）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 10（+2）</span><span>''智力'' 4（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 7（+0）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
